# 13. POST EDITOR

Use a mature structured rich-text editor such as Tiptap or another well-supported editor only after checking the project's current dependencies and official documentation.

Editor requirements:

- title
- dek/subtitle
- excerpt
- rich text
- headings
- paragraph
- bold
- italic
- links
- ordered list
- unordered list
- quote
- code block
- inline code
- divider
- image
- video/media embed
- caption
- callout
- undo/redo
- keyboard shortcuts
- autosave
- manual save
- preview
- publish
- revision history

Content must be stored as structured JSON.

A safely rendered HTML representation may also be persisted for read performance if it can be deterministically regenerated.

Never render unsanitized arbitrary HTML.

