# 14. EDITORIAL LAYOUT

The editor should feel like a serious writing environment, not a giant form.

Suggested layout:

```text
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ CINDERPRESS        Draft saved       Preview      Publish       │
├───────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┬───────────────┤
│               │                                  │               │
│ CONTENT       │        EDITORIAL CANVAS          │ PUBLISHING    │
│ NAVIGATION    │                                  │ SIDEBAR       │
│               │  Title                           │               │
│ Overview      │  Your headline...                │ Status        │
│ Content       │                                  │ Visibility    │
│ Media         │  Dek                             │ Author        │
│ SEO           │                                  │ Category      │
│ Revisions     │  Body                            │ Tags          │
│               │                                  │ Cover         │
│               │                                  │ SEO           │
└───────────────┴──────────────────────────────────┴───────────────┘
```

On mobile:

- collapse navigation
- make editor full-width
- move publishing options into a drawer/sheet
- keep save/publish actions reachable
- avoid unusably tiny controls

