# 15. PUBLIC ARTICLE DESIGN

The article reading experience is the heart of the product.

Target:

```text
                 PUBLICATION
                     CATEGORIES

       The headline should feel editorial,
       confident, and extremely readable.

       A meaningful dek gives context.

       AUTHOR · DATE · READING TIME

       ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
       │                                     │
       │            COVER MEDIA               │
       │                                     │
       └─────────────────────────────────────┘

       Article content begins here.

       Comfortable line length.
       Strong paragraph spacing.
       Excellent typography.

       Images are beautifully optimized.

       ─────────────────────────────────────

       Related stories
```

Recommended reading width:

approximately 680–760px for primary text, adjusted based on font metrics.

Do not make paragraphs span the entire desktop viewport.

