# 53. FINAL AGENT REPORT

At the end of implementation, provide a concise but complete report containing:

1. What was built.
2. Current architecture.
3. Cloudflare resources created/used.
4. Cloudinary resources/configuration used.
5. InsForge authentication integration status.
6. Database schema/migrations.
7. Routes created.
8. Important environment variables required.
9. Tests executed.
10. Browser checks executed.
11. Any remaining limitations.
12. Exact commands for local development.
13. Exact deployment command(s) supported by the current Cloudflare configuration.
14. Any manual dashboard steps that genuinely cannot be performed safely through MCP/CLI.

Do not claim an integration is complete unless it has actually been verified.

