# 54. FIRST ACTION

Begin now.

Start with:

```text
A. Inspect repository
B. Inspect current stack
C. Inspect installed design and infrastructure skills
D. Inspect connected Cloudflare / Cloudinary / InsForge MCP capabilities
E. Determine whether the repo is new or existing
F. Produce the implementation map
G. Start Phase 1
```

Then continue through the phases without unnecessary pauses.

The guiding product principle is:

> **Build a serious publishing instrument, not another generic AI SaaS dashboard.**

The visual principle is:

> **Warm white + black + disciplined Cloudflare-orange accents + geometric/isometric identity + editorial typography + precise borders + restrained depth.**

The architecture principle is:

> **InsForge = identity. Cloudflare = application/data/edge. Cloudinary = media.**

The engineering principle is:

> **Use Antigravity + MCP + official skills as the operating system for implementation, and never replace real security with convenience.**
